usage: corpus-nav.py lint-refs [-h] [--warn] [--limit LIMIT] [FILE ...]

positional arguments:
  FILE               files to lint (default: every block)

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --warn             report only; always exit 0
  --limit, -n LIMIT  max findings to print (default: 50; the summary counts
                     all)
